Package: opencsr
Title: Analysis Results Data and Display Engine for open.csr
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("open.csr", "contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "noreply@example.org")
Description: The R spine of open.csr. Prepares public ADaM data, interprets
    ARS-aligned analysis specifications into Analysis Results Data (ARD) via
    the 'cards' stack, serialises ARDs in an owned, provenance-stamped JSON
    schema, and renders ARD plus display specification into self-contained
    'gt' HTML displays. Every regeneration is recorded as a numbered
    iteration so the change-request loop is fully versioned.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    cards,
    digest,
    dplyr,
    gt,
    jsonlite,
    rlang,
    tibble,
    yaml
Suggests:
